{
  "duration": 240,
  "fps": 30,
  "voice": "macOS Tingting (zh_CN), 170 words per minute",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "001",
      "chapter": 0,
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 4.464,
      "text": "企业通过人的决策与学习，不断循环前行。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "002",
      "chapter": 0,
      "start": 6.212,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "信号来自客户、市场，或运营团队。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "003",
      "chapter": 0,
      "start": 11.544,
      "duration": 3.168,
      "text": "有人把信号变成值得解决的问题。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "004",
      "chapter": 0,
      "start": 15.292,
      "duration": 4.392,
      "text": "其他人制定计划、交付改进，再检验结果。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "005",
      "chapter": 0,
      "start": 20.648,
      "duration": 3.024,
      "text": "得到的经验，成为下一轮的起点。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "006",
      "chapter": 1,
      "start": 26.0,
      "duration": 3.168,
      "text": "设想，闭环中的每个人都有 Duet。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "007",
      "chapter": 1,
      "start": 29.629,
      "duration": 4.872,
      "text": "在这个虚构案例里，客户不清楚卡片激活的下一步。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "008",
      "chapter": 1,
      "start": 35.682,
      "duration": 2.928,
      "text": "研究员请 Duet 分析客户反馈。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "009",
      "chapter": 1,
      "start": 39.238,
      "duration": 5.136,
      "text": "它整理证据、追问关键问题，并准备一份工作摘要。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "010",
      "chapter": 1,
      "start": 45.507,
      "duration": 3.744,
      "text": "人负责判断，Duet 持续协助推进工作。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "011",
      "chapter": 1,
      "start": 50.504,
      "duration": 3.336,
      "text": "每个人的 Duet，都有各自的工作背景。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "012",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 56.0,
      "duration": 3.384,
      "text": "研究员把发现交给业务分析团队。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "013",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 60.045,
      "duration": 3.792,
      "text": "分析师与 Duet 一起写出清晰的用户故事。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "014",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 64.689,
      "duration": 2.976,
      "text": "让客户看懂卡片激活的下一步。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "015",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 68.47,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "他们明确范围、客户旅程，以及验收标准。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "016",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 73.93,
      "duration": 3.816,
      "text": "文档在对话、审阅和修正中逐步完善。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "017",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 78.911,
      "duration": 4.536,
      "text": "业务负责人评估价值、依赖关系和可用产能。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "018",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 84.635,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": "由人决定先做什么，哪些留待以后。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "019",
      "chapter": 2,
      "start": 88.776,
      "duration": 3.792,
      "text": "Duet 关联决策、依据材料和下一步行动。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "020",
      "chapter": 3,
      "start": 96.0,
      "duration": 3.216,
      "text": "消息中心，让交接清晰可见。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "021",
      "chapter": 3,
      "start": 99.437,
      "duration": 4.176,
      "text": "分析师的 Duet 向指定对象发布已确认的需求。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "022",
      "chapter": 3,
      "start": 104.578,
      "duration": 4.344,
      "text": "一条消息，关联来源、文件和投送状态。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "023",
      "chapter": 3,
      "start": 110.486,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": "接收方的 Duet 向各自主人汇报进展。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "024",
      "chapter": 3,
      "start": 114.691,
      "duration": 3.888,
      "text": "问题和反馈也能传回来，让讨论继续。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "025",
      "chapter": 3,
      "start": 120.096,
      "duration": 3.192,
      "text": "信息找到人，人再推动下一步。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "026",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 126.0,
      "duration": 4.416,
      "text": "敏捷协调人的 Duet 汇总需求，标出依赖关系。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/026.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "027",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 131.732,
      "duration": 3.888,
      "text": "经授权后，它向开发人员的 Duet 咨询。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/027.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "028",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 136.071,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": "每个人确认自己负责的范围和承诺。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/028.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "029",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 140.291,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "复杂工作可以委派，结果回来后再审阅。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/029.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "030",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 145.134,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "计划、文件和测试证据始终关联着任务。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/030.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "031",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 150.362,
      "duration": 4.104,
      "text": "结果是否达到验收标准，仍由人来判断。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/031.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "032",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 155.205,
      "duration": 5.424,
      "text": "生产系统集成属于未来阶段，发布决定始终由人掌握。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/032.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "033",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 161.489,
      "duration": 2.664,
      "text": "再通过消息中心发布进展。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/033.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "034",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 165.012,
      "duration": 4.824,
      "text": "运营反馈回到研究环节：还有哪些问题没有解决？",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/034.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "035",
      "chapter": 4,
      "start": 170.528,
      "duration": 3.216,
      "text": "这一轮的结果，成为下一轮的问题。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/035.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "036",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 176.0,
      "duration": 2.808,
      "text": "每轮循环，都能加深合作。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/036.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "037",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 179.081,
      "duration": 4.656,
      "text": "修正、偏好和项目背景，成为可复用的记忆。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/037.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "038",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 185.306,
      "duration": 3.504,
      "text": "Duet 梳理经验，在后续工作中运用。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/038.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "039",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 190.283,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "text": "设想它承担的合适工作，从百分之十，到五十，再到九十五。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/039.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "040",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 196.965,
      "duration": 3.168,
      "text": "这是演进愿景，不是实测结果。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/040.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "041",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 200.958,
      "duration": 3.864,
      "text": "进步依赖已验证的能力，以及明确授权。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/041.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "042",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 205.815,
      "duration": 4.224,
      "text": "人保留关键决策，Duet 承担更多日常执行。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/042.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "043",
      "chapter": 5,
      "start": 211.248,
      "duration": 2.352,
      "text": "新一轮，理解更进一步。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/043.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "044",
      "chapter": 6,
      "start": 216.0,
      "duration": 2.568,
      "text": "整个组织，始终由人主导。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/044.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "045",
      "chapter": 6,
      "start": 219.509,
      "duration": 2.376,
      "text": "Duet 通过授权的连接协作。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/045.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "046",
      "chapter": 6,
      "start": 223.186,
      "duration": 2.808,
      "text": "消息中心传递信号和成果。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/046.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "047",
      "chapter": 6,
      "start": 226.982,
      "duration": 3.672,
      "text": "每个人都有 Duet，每次交接都有连接。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/047.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "048",
      "chapter": 6,
      "start": 232.003,
      "duration": 2.856,
      "text": "每次循环，让业务更进一步。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/048.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "049",
      "chapter": 6,
      "start": 235.128,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "text": "Duet，人主导的 AI 原生组织。",
      "audio": "voiceover-zh-CN/049.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
